// The comparison set's spall cone: the candidate "simple" field law the pen cam demo draws beside
// the shipped one (`assets/ballistics/spall_cone.ron`, whose comments define every field). The
// records beside this file are the same scenarios (`../scenarios.ron`) recorded under it by
// `ballistics::pen_cam`. Dev data: nothing in the game reads it.
//
// PROVENANCE: every value is authored `(value, Kind("source or reason"))`, as the shipped file's.
(
    half_angle_deg: (25.0, Tuned("the shipped value, so the comparison isolates profile and
        passage")),
    axis: (RearNormalBisector, Tuned("the shipped rule, so the comparison isolates profile and
        passage")),
    directions: (256, Resolution("dense enough that a box's dose follows its solid angle from the
        origin. Cost MEASURED 2026-10-17 by ballistics::pen_cam::spall_law_cost (release, macOS
        arm64, 8 cones over the penetrating scenarios): 2.5 ms per throw, against 0.33 ms for the
        shipped 24 directions")),
    profile: (Flat, Tuned("candidate, owner 2026-10-17: uniform density across the cone, the same
        emitted total S/2 as the shipped law")),
    passage: (FirstSolid, Tuned("candidate, owner 2026-10-17: a direction stops at the first
        solid it enters; a box there takes its whole strength")),
)
